Those who are curious to learn about the Japanese culture, etiquette, and their way of doing business would greatly benefit from studying at Fujiwara Institute. You'll not just learn how to hold basic conversations in Japanese but also be able to read and write in its script. The kind and supportive instructors at the institute are committed to helping you at every step of the way to achieve proficiency in the Japanese language.
You'll also get the opportunity to interact with students, teachers and distinguished guests from Japan through Cross-Cultural Programs which could help you expand your business, work and career prospects.
Fujiwara Institute do conduct Japan tour Twice a year
